Power named the Ram fifteen hundred the

5
00:00:05,864 --> 00:00:08,695
most dependable full-size pickup in America.

6
00:00:08,875 --> 00:00:10,133
Two months earlier,

7
00:00:10,133 --> 00:00:12,913
Consumer Reports had called the same truck

8
00:00:12,913 --> 00:00:15,362
