199
00:07:19,037 --> 00:07:21,701
about problems in the last twelve months.

200
00:07:21,881 --> 00:07:26,109
Thirty-three thousand, two hundred sixty-eight owners responded,

201
00:07:26,109 --> 00:07:28,685
according to Pickup Truck and SUV Talk.

202
00:07:28,865 --> 00:07:31,349
The score is problems per one hundred

203
00:07:31,349 --> 00:07:31,953
vehicles.

204
00:07:32,133 --> 00:07:33,503
Lower is better.

205
00:07:33,853 --> 00:07:35,920
And here is the result that started

206
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:36,569
this video.

207
00:07:36,749 --> 00:07:39,383
In the large light-duty pickup segment,

208
00:07:39,383 --> 00:07:42,017
the Ram fifteen hundred finished first,

209
00:07:42,017 --> 00:07:44,110
up from fourth the year before.

210
00:07:44,290 --> 00:07:47,483
The Chevrolet Silverado fifteen hundred was second.

211
00:07:47,663 --> 00:07:50,677
The GMC Sierra and Ford F-150 tied

212
00:07:50,677 --> 00:07:51,564
for third.

213
00:07:51,744 --> 00:07:54,023
And the Toyota Tundra was not in

214
00:07:54,023 --> 00:07:55,519
the top three at all,

215
00:07:55,519 --> 00:07:58,084
which Pickup Truck and SUV Talk said

216
00:07:58,084 --> 00:08:00,649
placed it below the segment average.

217
00:08:00,999 --> 00:08:02,746
So how can the Ram be first

218
00:08:02,746 --> 00:08:04,946
here and last in Consumer Reports?

219
00:08:05,126 --> 00:08:06,972
Look at what each one measures.

220
00:08:07,152 --> 00:08:07,419
J.

221
00:08:07,599 --> 00:08:07,796
D.

222
00:08:07,976 --> 00:08:10,911
Power surveyed twenty twenty-three trucks,

223
00:08:10,911 --> 00:08:11,959
three years in.

224
00:08:12,139 --> 00:08:15,926
Consumer Reports predicts reliability for new models

225
00:08:15,926 --> 00:08:18,330
using the last three model years,

226
00:08:18,330 --> 00:08:21,025
and the Ram fifteen hundred changed a

227
00:08:21,025 --> 00:08:22,992
lot for twenty twenty-five,

228
00:08:22,992 --> 00:08:25,687
with new engines and new electronics.

229
00:08:25,867 --> 00:08:28,607
One looks backward at older trucks.

230
00:08:28,787 --> 00:08:31,277
The other tries to predict the trucks

231
00:08:31,277 --> 00:08:32,085
on sale now.

232
00:08:32,435 --> 00:08:34,124
Now the brand ranking,

233
00:08:34,124 --> 00:08:35,813
as reported by Motor1.

234
00:08:35,993 --> 00:08:38,695
The industry average was two hundred four

235
00:08:38,695 --> 00:08:40,672
problems per hundred vehicles.

236
00:08:40,852 --> 00:08:43,778
Lexus was best at one hundred fifty-one.

237
00:08:43,958 --> 00:08:46,867
Chevrolet was fifth overall at one hundred

238
00:08:46,867 --> 00:08:49,222
seventy-eight, better than Toyota,

239
00:08:49,222 --> 00:08:52,270
which was eighth at one hundred eighty-five.

240
00:08:52,450 --> 00:08:55,376
Nissan was tenth at one hundred ninety-four.

241
00:08:55,556 --> 00:08:57,250
And at the other end,

242
00:08:57,250 --> 00:09:00,236
Ford scored two hundred twenty-eight,

243
00:09:00,236 --> 00:09:02,495
GMC two hundred twenty-nine,

244
00:09:02,495 --> 00:09:05,158
and Jeep two hundred sixty-seven.

245
00:09:05,508 --> 00:09:06,808
Here is the twist.

246
00:09:06,988 --> 00:09:07,766
In J.

247
00:09:07,946 --> 00:09:08,097
D.

248
00:09:08,277 --> 00:09:10,594
Power's dependability ranking,

249
00:09:10,594 --> 00:09:12,294
Chevrolet beat Toyota.

250
00:09:12,474 --> 00:09:15,307
And GMC, which sells almost the same

251
00:09:15,307 --> 00:09:16,881
trucks as Chevrolet,

252
00:09:16,881 --> 00:09:18,849
finished near the bottom,

253
00:09:18,849 --> 00:09:20,659
