00:10:08,304 --> 00:10:09,436
hundred vehicles.

277
00:10:09,616 --> 00:10:12,146
Plug-in hybrids had the most problems,

278
00:10:12,146 --> 00:10:13,677
two hundred eighty-one,

279
00:10:13,677 --> 00:10:15,142
up thirty-nine points.

280
00:10:15,322 --> 00:10:19,345
Electric vehicles and hybrids each rose fourteen

281
00:10:19,345 --> 00:10:19,931
points.

282
00:10:20,111 --> 00:10:21,333
So in this study,

283
00:10:21,333 --> 00:10:24,422
